# React Rules

## Naming

- Pages: `PascalCase.jsx` in `src/pages/`
- Components: `PascalCase.jsx` in `src/components/`
- Hooks: `useX.js` in `src/hooks/`
- Context: `XContext.jsx` in `src/context/`

## Component structure

```jsx
export default function ComponentName({ prop1, prop2 }) {
  // hooks first
  // handlers
  // return JSX
}
```

## Do NOT modify

- `AuthContext.jsx` — frozen
- `vite.config.js` — frozen
- `index.html` — frozen

## Imports

```js
import { useState, useEffect } from "react";
import ComponentName from "../components/ComponentName.jsx";  // explicit .jsx
```

## Tailwind CSS 4

- Utility classes only — no inline `style=`
- No CSS-in-JS libraries
- No CSS Modules

## State

- `useState` for local UI state
- `useContext(AuthContext)` for auth
- No Redux, Zustand, or external state managers

## Hooks

- Always at top of component — never inside conditions
- Custom hooks return `{ data, loading, error }` pattern
